{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "grp-human-pov-01",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -1100,
      "width": 2900,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "#3B82F6",
      "label": "Zone 1 · Human POV 人類視角"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-request-path-02",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 5800,
      "height": 570,
      "color": "#3B82F6",
      "label": "Zone 2 · Shared Request Backbone 共用請求主幹"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-credentials-03",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 3800,
      "height": 1600,
      "color": "#8B5CF6",
      "label": "Zone 3 · Credential Acquisition 憑證取得"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-policies-04",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 4800,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 3900,
      "height": 1800,
      "color": "#F59E0B",
      "label": "Zone 4 · Policy Evaluation 政策評估"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-customer-01",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Customer 客戶\nClicks **Download invoice**\n點擊下載發票",
      "x": 100,
      "y": -950,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#3B82F6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-employee-02",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Employee 員工\nRuns an **AWS CLI command**\n執行 AWS CLI 指令",
      "x": 800,
      "y": -950,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#3B82F6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-federated-03",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Federated user 聯合身份使用者\nSigns in through a company identity\n透過公司身份登入",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": -950,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#3B82F6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-operator-04",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Operator 操作人員\nTriggers an application or Lambda workflow\n觸發應用程式或 Lambda 工作流程",
      "x": 2200,
      "y": -950,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#3B82F6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-human-intent",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Human intent 人類意圖\nThe business action the human wants completed\n人類希望完成的業務動作",
      "x": 100,
      "y": -350,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "#3B82F6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-client",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Client 用戶端\nBrowser · Application · AWS CLI · Lambda\nClient software executes the API call\n用戶端軟件執行 API 呼叫",
      "x": 800,
      "y": -350,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "#3B82F6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-sdk",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AWS SDK — Software Development Kit\n## 軟件開發工具套件\n`s3.getObject(bucket, key)` is an **in-process method call**, not yet a network request.\nSDK converts it into an HTTPS request.\nSDK 將方法呼叫轉換成 HTTPS 請求。",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": -350,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#3B82F6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-credential-provider",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Credential provider 憑證提供者\nSDK credential provider **obtains and caches** a valid credential set, then refreshes it near expiry.\nSDK 憑證提供者取得並快取有效憑證，接近到期時更新。",
      "x": 2200,
      "y": -350,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#8B5CF6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-sigv4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## SigV4 request signing 請求簽署\nThe **SDK performs SigV4 signing locally** on the client side.\nSDK 在用戶端本機簽署 HTTPS 請求；IAM 或 STS 不會逐次代簽。",
      "x": 2900,
      "y": -350,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#8B5CF6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-aws-service",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AWS service AWS 服務\n**Amazon S3 authenticates the signed request** after it arrives.\nAmazon S3 收到請求後驗證簽章與憑證。",
      "x": 3600,
      "y": -350,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "#22C55E"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-request-context",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Request context 請求情境\nContains **Principal + Action + Resource + Conditions** and other request facts.\n包含主體身份、動作、資源、條件及其他請求事實。",
      "x": 4300,
      "y": -350,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "#22C55E"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-policy-eval",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Policy evaluation 政策評估\nAWS identifies the Principal, loads all applicable policy sources, and authorizes on the AWS side.\nAWS 識別主體身份、載入適用政策，並在 AWS 端授權。",
      "x": 5000,
      "y": -350,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#F59E0B"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-iam-role",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## IAM Role via instance profile\n## 透過執行個體設定檔使用 IAM 角色\nIAM stores identity and authorization configuration.\nIAM 儲存身份與授權設定；**IAM service itself is never the Principal**。",
      "x": 1020,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#8B5CF6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-instance-profile",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Instance profile 執行個體設定檔\nContainer that makes one IAM Role available to an EC2 instance.\n讓 EC2 執行個體取得一個 IAM 角色的容器。",
      "x": 1640,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "#8B5CF6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-ec2-assumes-role",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AWS/EC2 assumes the role\n## AWS／EC2 代執行個體擔任角色\nThe role trust policy allows the EC2 service principal to assume it.\n角色信任政策允許 EC2 服務主體擔任該角色。",
      "x": 2260,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#8B5CF6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-sts-session",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## STS — Security Token Service\n## 安全權杖服務\n**STS creates an AppRole assumed-role session and issues temporary credentials.**\nSTS 建立 AppRole 擔任角色工作階段並簽發臨時憑證。",
      "x": 2880,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#8B5CF6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-temporary-credentials",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Temporary credentials 臨時憑證\n1. **Access key ID** 存取金鑰 ID\n2. **Secret access key** 私密存取金鑰\n3. **Session token** 工作階段權杖",
      "x": 3500,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "#8B5CF6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-imds",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## IMDS — Instance Metadata Service\n## 執行個體中繼資料服務\n**IMDS exposes rotating credentials** to software on the instance.\nIMDS 向執行個體內的軟件提供輪替中的臨時憑證。",
      "x": 3500,
      "y": 860,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#8B5CF6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-principal-model",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Principal model 主體身份模型\n**Principal = the identity represented by the signing credentials.**\n主體身份是簽署憑證所代表的身份。\n\nHuman 人類 → initiates business intent\nApplication / CLI 應用程式／CLI → client software\nEC2 instance EC2 執行個體 → host\n**AppRole assumed-role session** → Principal seen by AWS",
      "x": 1020,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 1160,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "#8B5CF6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-iam-user-alternative",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## IAM user access-key alternative\n## IAM 使用者存取金鑰替代路徑\n**If IAM-user access keys sign instead, the Principal is that IAM user.**\n若以 IAM 使用者存取金鑰簽署，主體身份就是該 IAM 使用者；IAM 服務本身不是主體身份。",
      "x": 2300,
      "y": 1230,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "#8B5CF6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-credential-cadence",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "> **Credential acquisition path 憑證取得路徑 — not a per-request hop 並非每次請求都經過**\n> **Not every API request creates a new STS session.** The provider reuses cached credentials and refreshes near expiry.\n> 並非每次 API 請求都建立新的 STS 工作階段；提供者重用快取憑證並在接近到期時更新。",
      "x": 1020,
      "y": 1580,
      "width": 2000,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#6B7280"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-identity-policy",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Identity-based policy 身份型政策\nStored in IAM; attached to a user or role.\n儲存在 IAM，可授予權限；自身的隱含拒絕不等於明確拒絕。",
      "x": 4920,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "#F59E0B"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-resource-policy",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Resource-based policy 資源型政策\nStored on the resource, such as an S3 bucket policy.\n儲存在資源設定，可向指定主體身份授予存取權。",
      "x": 5540,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "#F59E0B"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Permissions boundary 權限邊界\nMaximum permissions for an IAM user or role.\n設定權限上限，本身不授予權限。",
      "x": 6160,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "#F59E0B"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-session-policy",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Session policy 工作階段政策\nOptional restriction applied when creating a session.\n建立工作階段時可加入，只能收窄工作階段權限。",
      "x": 4920,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "#F59E0B"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-scp",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## SCP — Service Control Policy\n## 服務控制政策\nOrganization-level identity/account-side permission ceiling.\n組織層級身份／帳戶端權限上限；本身不授予權限。",
      "x": 5540,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#F59E0B"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-rcp",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## RCP — Resource Control Policy\n## 資源控制政策\nOrganization-level resource-side permission ceiling.\n組織層級資源端權限上限；**SCP and RCP do not grant permissions.**",
      "x": 6160,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#F59E0B"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-policies-not-request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Policy location 政策位置\n**Policies do not travel inside the request.**\nThey remain in IAM, resource configuration, session configuration, or AWS Organizations. AWS loads applicable sources using Principal, Resource, Account, and Organization context.\n政策留在 IAM、資源設定、工作階段設定或 AWS Organizations；AWS 依主體身份、資源、帳戶與組織情境載入。",
      "x": 6780,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "#F59E0B"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-explicit-deny",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Applicable Explicit Deny\n## 適用的明確拒絕\nAn applicable Explicit Deny overrides every Allow.\n→ **DENY 拒絕**",
      "x": 4920,
      "y": 1370,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "#EF4444"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-effective-allow",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Applicable Allow + ceilings permit\n## 適用 Allow 且所有上限放行\nAn applicable Allow can succeed only when every relevant permission ceiling permits it.\n→ **ALLOW 允許**",
      "x": 5540,
      "y": 1370,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#22C55E"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-implicit-deny",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## No effective Allow\n## 沒有有效 Allow\nWithout an effective Allow, the default result is:\n→ **Implicit Deny 隱含拒絕**",
      "x": 6160,
      "y": 1370,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "#6B7280"
    }
  ],
